al bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  abstains from \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market, the real could rebound Wednesday amid continued strong inflows of exporter dollars.  \par \par \uc2 -By Bernd Radowitz, Dow Jones Newswires; 5521-3288-5004; bernd.radowitz@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires  \par \par \uc2 10-05-05 0919ET  \par \par \uc2 Dokument OSTDJ00020051005e1a5003sg\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
