\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Brazil  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  resumes dollar buying  \b0\par\par\uc2 312 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Oktober 2005\par 17:31\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (Adds quotes)  \par \par \uc2 BRASILIA, Brazil, Oct 3 (Reuters) - Just two trading sessions after warning investors it could \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  "at any moment," \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  held an auction to buy dollars on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market after a six-month hiatus.  \par \par \uc2 But the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  did little to weaken the real from a four-year high that has curbed inflationary pressures yet worried exporters.  \par \par \uc2 The buying price was fixed at 2.231 reais per U.S. dollar in the 10-minute auction which began at 11:18 a.m. (1418 GMT), the bank said in a statement. The bank took three offers, according to traders. It normally doesn't say how much it might have bought.  \par \par \uc2 After the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it had returned to the dollar market, the real <BRBY> weakened 0.45 percent to 2.24 to the dollar.  \par \par \uc2 "On Thursday the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it could \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the next hour, or next month. It was signaled," said Alexandre Vasarhelyi, head of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  at ING in Sao Paulo.  \par \par \uc2 The real later recovered slightly and was trading near where it opened the session, at 2.237, or 0.31 percent weaker on the day.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  halted the purchases back in March and since then the real reached four-year highs.  \par \par \uc2 Even though exports this year are forecast to hit a record, exporters have clamored for \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to make their even products more competitive on global markets.  \par \par \uc2 Under the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy, it can wade into the market to correct liquidity imbalances and use the dollars it buys to rebuild scant foreign reserves, which credit rating agencies say need to rise if Brazil is to attain investment grade status.  \par \par \uc2 ECONOMY-BRAZIL-\b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|E|RBN|M|D|U|RNP|DNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020051003e1a3001c1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
