\par\par \b \uc2 DJ Brazil Real Closes Weaker After Central Bk Buys Dlrs  \b0\par\par\uc2 261 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Januar 2005\par 21:05\par \uc2 OsterDowJones Commodity Wire\par \uc2 OSTDJ\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2005, Comtex News Network.  All Rights Reserved.  Standard Attribution Statement: News Provided by COMTEX.  \par \par \uc2 RIO DE JANEIRO, Jan 05, 2005 (ODC via COMTEX) --  \par \par \uc2 The Brazilian real closed lower Wednesday as \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market buying U.S. dollars and after the U.S. Federal Reserve Board released minutes from its December meeting Tuesday that hinted at a further hike in interest rates. The real closed at BRL2.708 to against the dollar, weaker than Tuesday's close at BRL2.70 per dollar. Following trends at international \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets that saw the euro and the yen weakening against the U.S. dollar earlier in the day, the real weakened to as low as BRL2.735 in morning trading. The strengthening of the dollar came after the Federal Reserve released minutes that were interpreted as a prelude to continued gradual rate hikes. Brazil competes with the U.S. to attract international investors. When the Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strengthened again, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  at an early-afternoon auction on Wednesday bought U.S. dollars at a rate of BRL2.701, the bank said. The bank didn't reveal the volume of dollars it purchased. The real weakened after the auction to its closing price. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  started almost daily auctions of dollars in early December. \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Henrique Meirelles repeatedly said the purchases are aimed at propping up foreign reserves and not intended to stop a further strengthening of the real.  \par \par \uc2 -By Bernd Radowitz, Dow Jones Newswires; 5521-3288-5004; bernd.radowitz@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 Copyright 2004 Dow Jones. All rights reserved.  \par \par \uc2 Dokument OSTDJ00020050106e115000ke\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
