\par\par \b \uc2 Brazil Real Closes Weaker After Central Bk Buys Dlrs  \b0\par\par\uc2 255 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Januar 2005\par 20:12\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 RIO DE JANEIRO (Dow Jones)--The Brazilian real closed lower Wednesday as \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market buying U.S. dollars and after the U.S. Federal Reserve Board released minutes from its December meeting Tuesday that hinted at a further hike in interest rates.  \par \par \uc2 The real closed at BRL2.708 to against the dollar, weaker than Tuesday's close at BRL2.70 per dollar.  \par \par \uc2 Following trends at international \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets that saw the euro and the yen weakening against the U.S. dollar earlier in the day, the real weakened to as low as BRL2.735 in morning trading.  \par \par \uc2 The strengthening of the dollar came after the Federal Reserve released minutes that were interpreted as a prelude to continued gradual rate hikes.  \par \par \uc2 Brazil competes with the U.S. to attract international investors.  \par \par \uc2 When the Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strengthened again, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  at an early-afternoon auction on Wednesday bought U.S. dollars at a rate of BRL2.701, the bank said. The bank didn't reveal the volume of dollars it purchased.  \par \par \uc2 The real weakened after the auction to its closing price.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  started almost daily auctions of dollars in early December. \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Henrique Meirelles repeatedly said the purchases are aimed at propping up foreign reserves and not intended to stop a further strengthening of the real.  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    -By Bernd Radowitz, Dow Jones Newswires; 5521-3288-5004; \par bernd.radowitz@dowjones.com \par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 05-01-05 1912GMT ]  \f28 \par \par \uc2 1156 1843  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020050105e115000ni\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
