okerage in Sao Paulo, said.   \par \par \uc2 "But it needs to do something more proactive because the \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  aren't working," he added.   \par \par \uc2 Stocks, meanwhile, stood to gain as Brazil's country risk rating, a measure of the interest rate penalty Brazil must pay to borrow abroad, was at its lowest levels since 1997.   \par \par \uc2 Bellwether stock Tele Norte Leste Participacoes (TNLP4.SA) was 0.65 percent higher at 43.45 reais.    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020041220e0ck00fd7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
