\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  real up but  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  seen, stocks slip.   \b0\par\par\uc2 251 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Dezember 2004\par 15:13\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO, \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Dec 17 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's real strengthened early on Friday on a wave of dollars inflows while stocks retreated from a record closing high set on Thursday.   \par \par \uc2 The local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the real , gained 0.15 percent early to 2.736 per dollar, with traders saying the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may buy dollars under a plan announced last week to rebuild foreign reserves. The purchases, when large enough, have weakened the real, which exporters fears is overvalued. The real is trading at its strongest levels since June 2002 thanks to strong inflows from exports and overseas bond sales.   \par \par \uc2 The Bovespa index of the Sao Paulo Stocks Exchange slipped 0.56 percent in early trade to 25,685 points after five days of gains pushed it to a record close of 25,831 points in the previous session. Bellwether Tele Norte Leste Participacoes (TNLP4.SA) fell 0.39 percent early to 68.50 reais.   \par \par \uc2 Stocks gained on Thursday as a growing number of investors bet Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  late Wednesday made what could be its last hike of an interest rate tightening cycle started in September.   \par \par \uc2 On Wednesday, Brazil raised its benchmark lending rate half a percentage point to 17.75 percent - its fourth hike in as many months.   \par \par \uc2 Traders believe inflation is now in check, permitting the country's benchmark rate to stay unchanged at 17.75 percent a year at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's next monetary policy meeting in January.    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020041217e0ch00cfq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
