\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  real gains despite  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 , stocks up.   \b0\par\par\uc2 488 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Dezember 2004\par 22:02\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO, \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Dec 13 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strengthened on Monday despite an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy U.S. dollars, while stocks also scaled higher toward a historic high reached last week.   \par \par \uc2 Boosted by an expected interest rate hike on Wednesday by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the dollar's slide against the euro, the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the real , gained 0.36 percent to close at 2.766 per dollar. The Bovespa index of the Sao Paulo Stock Exchange rose 1.17 percent to 25,225 points.   \par \par \uc2 The real gained even though the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  held its fourth auction to buy dollars since last Monday, when the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it would start buying greenbacks to rebuild scant foreign reserves. Economists have said the plan will also help weaken a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  that some exporters believe is overvalued. The real lost about 3 percent last week.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought dollars at 2.768 on Monday, traders said. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  normally does not disclose the price and amount of dollars it purchases.   \par \par \uc2 Traders said Monday's purchase appeared to be small and left them guessing about how much the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  wants to weaken the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Many exporters want the real to weaken to 3 per dollar.   \par \par \uc2 "I don't know if the market is testing the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but I think the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't buy a lot of dollars," Francisco Carvalho, a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader at the Liquidez brokerage said. "The market is selling dollars heavily and as soon as the auction was over, the selling resumed."   \par \par \uc2 Traders said that the real may rally on Tuesday after state-run Banco do Brasil sold 200 million reais in global bonds on Monday that are denominated in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 Stocks posted moderate gains and finished within several hundred points of its record high close of 25,632.50 posted last Monday.   \par \par \uc2 Though they have been buoyed by a positive outlook for growth and stability in Latin America's largest country, stocks are expected to come under pressure this week as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  prepares for a likely interest rate hike on Wednesday.   \par \par \uc2 Still, some traders are betting falling inflation expectations may allow the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to refrain from hiking rates in January.   \par \par \uc2 Bellwether Tele Norte Leste Participacoes (TNLP4.SA), which comprises about 12 percent of the index, rose 1.23 percent to 42.01 reais.   \par \par \uc2 Banco Bradesco (BBDC4.SA) gained 3.2 percent after closing a financing agreement with a small bank and Banco Itau (ITAU4.SA) climbed 1.79 percent to 397 reais after buying a small car loan company. Phone company Embratel's ordinary shares (EBTP3.SA) fell 3.6 percent to 15.00 reais after parent company Telmex bought back 80 percent of its unit's outstanding ordinary shares in a $269.5 million tender offer.   \par \par \uc2 (Additional reporting by Nathalia Ferreira and Marcelo Mota).    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020041213e0cd00el8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
