\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  real drops as cenbank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2 , stocks ebb.  \b0\par\par\uc2 414 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Dezember 2004\par 22:28\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO, \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Dec 7 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought dollars for a second day in a row on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Tuesday, sending the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  1 percent lower, and stocks took a blow from low prices at a giant energy auction.  \par \par \uc2 The Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the real, fell just over 1 percent to 2.747 per U.S. dollar after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought dollars at 2.722 to rebuild foreign reserves.  \par \par \uc2 The real, which hit a 2-1/2-year closing peak against the dollar on Friday, reversed course on Monday sliding 0.37 percent after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced it was \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market for the first time since February.  \par \par \uc2 "They are not buying big lots, but their presence inhibits dollar sales. If the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  maintains its stance, the dollar easing trend should be inverted," said Marco Antonio Azevedo, head of \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  at Brascan bank.  \par \par \uc2 Some government ministers say the real is too strong and could hurt export competitiveness in coming months.  \par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the main Bovespa index of the Sao Paulo Stock Exchange fell 2.5 percent to 24,988 points after failing to hang onto historic highs reached in the previous session as power utilities crumbled.  \par \