\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  real extends fall on new cenbank  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 .   \b0\par\par\uc2 300 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Dezember 2004\par 15:44\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO, \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Dec 7 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought dollars for a second straight day on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Tuesday, sending the Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  down nearly 1 percent.   \par \par \uc2 The local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the real , fell 0.96 percent to 2.745 per U.S. dollar after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said buy dollars to rebuild foreign reserves.   \par \par \uc2 The real, which hit a 2-1/2-year closing peak against the dollar on Friday, reversed course on Monday sliding 0.37 percent after the bank announced it was \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market for the first time since February.   \par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the main Bovespa index of the Sao Paulo Stock Exchange struggled to hang onto historic highs reached in the previous session and fell 0.91 percent to 25,409 points.   \par \par \uc2 Some industrialists and economists say the real is too strong and could hurt export competitiveness in coming months.   \par \par \uc2 "The real has been pressured since the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought a little more than it did yesterday," Alexandre Vasarhelyi, head \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader at ING in Sao Paulo, said.   \par \par \uc2 On Monday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought about $30 million, traders said. The volume purchased on Tuesday likely will not be known until later in the trading session, but traders said the purchases occurred at the 2.722 rate.   \par \par \uc2 Among individual stocks, bellwether Tele Norte Leste Participacoes (TNLP4.SA) rose 0.49 percent to 42.80 reais, while state-run oil giant Petrobras (PETR4.SA) fell 0.69 percent to 93.50 reais.   \par \par \uc2 Shares of brewer Ambev (AMBV4.SA) rose 0.93 percent to 757.00 reais, despite reports that parent company InBev's (INTB.BR) purchase of a controlling stake in Russia's SUN Interbrew (SBREqa.F) was delayed.   \par \par \uc2 (Additional reporting by Nathalia Ferreira).    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020041207e0c7009w9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
