flows to the country.   \par \par \uc2 The country posted an $817 million current account surplus in March with help of a $2.6 billion trade surplus during the month.   \par \par \uc2 Given strategic government \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's real has held steady for most of the first quarter. However, according to recent market surveys by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is expected to weaken to BRL3.05 per dollar by the year's end.   \par \par \uc2 -By Gerald Jeffris, Dow Jones Newswires; 55-61-8123-6883; gerald.jeffris@dowjones.com [ 27-04-04 2055GMT ]   \par \par \uc2 1156 1843   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020040427e04r00141\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
